{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>For Pharaoh's horse came.</b> In my opinion, this verse too is part of the Song, to recall the wonder He performed within a wonder, as I explained." "And the word עליהם in סוס פרעה ברכבו ובפרשיו — Pharaoh too was with them, for so it is written: אמר אויב, who is Pharaoh, and after him תבלעמו ארץ; and it is explicitly written: ונער פרעה וחילו בים סוף (Psalms 136:15)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:49.034645512Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}